values are provided for both the pre-harmonization analysis and the post-harmonization analysis using the ComBat method. Finally, at the bottom of the table, Model 4 is reported, which was obtained using 1000 bootstrap populations with RFs harmonized via the ComBat method.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="center" valign="middle" style="border-top:solid thin;border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
